          <td>The 1940 passport file and the Cape Town <em>matrícula consular</em></td>
          <td><span class="chip doc">Sent 9 Sep 2026</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="https://iisg.amsterdam/en/contact">International Institute of Social History</a>,
          Amsterdam<br><span class="cap">ask@iisg.nl</span></td>
          <td>The Argentine anarchist press and Ley 4144 deportations, 1902–06</td>
          <td><span class="chip doc">Sent 9 Sep 2026</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="https://www.argentina.gob.ar/interior/archivo-general-de-la-nacion">Archivo General
          de la Nación</a></td>
          <td>Ley 4144 expulsion files</td>
          <td><span class="chip inf">Written, not sent</span> — no public email; the portal needs a
